GUPI Privacy Policy

Last updated: 2026-02-07

Summary
GUPI blocks gambling-related content, ads, and risky redirects locally in your browser. The extension does not collect or transmit personal data.

Data Collection
- The extension does not collect or transmit personal information to any external server.
- Data stored locally in your browser (Chrome storage only):
  - User preferences (on/off, safeguards, focus mode).
  - Allowlist (user-approved domains).
  - Counters for blocked items.

Data Usage
- Local data is used only to provide the extension’s features.

Data Sharing
- No data is sold or shared with third parties.

Security
- All detection and blocking run locally in the browser.
- No external processing of user data.

Contact
For questions, please use the developer contact information listed on the Chrome Web Store page.
